  schools:
  - button: {fileID: 804}
    tileImage: {fileID: 0}
    selectedBorder: {fileID: 101}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e74ff25fbc9617f498979e9419e560c0, type: 2}
    displayName: Sacred Gate
    description: 'Direction: Located in West

      Description: The first educational
      institution built by the Sacred Financial Group. Boasting Eastern infrastructures
      and designs, this campus is the center of History, Social Science, Language
      and Literature. It also boasts a huge library dedicated to Shamanism and researches
      related to martial arts.'
  - button: {fileID: 739}
    tileImage: {fileID: 0}
    selectedBorder: {fileID: 73}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 41698fe8b5ae18143a139b6bb2b9b7da, type: 2}
    displayName: Mystic Peak
    description: "Direction: Located in North\nDescription: The second campus created
      by the Sacred Financial Group located at the Northern area of RAN world. Its
      aura reflects the grandeur of Western civilizations in their prime. The stained
      glass windows, scenic plazas, and rich flora and fauna reflect the academe\u2019s
      dedication to the Arts and Natural Science."
  - button: {fileID: 788}
    tileImage: {fileID: 0}
    selectedBorder: {fileID: 108}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ced20ecd35c3bac4dac5e303ff48b5b4, type: 2}
    displayName: Phoenix
    description: 'Direction: Located in West

      Description: The first educational
      institution built by the Sacred Financial Group. Boasting Eastern infrastructures
      and designs, this campus is the center of History, Social Science, Language
      and Literature. It also boasts a huge library dedicated to Shamanism and researches
      related to martial arts.'
  genders:
  - button: {fileID: 684}
    tileImage: {fileID: 0}
    selectedBorder: {fileID: 137}
    descriptionIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 070022c7fea0be3458f426076eb98adc, type: 2}
    displayName: Male
    prefab: {fileID: 1709254077376921, guid: 75af8316f642788478262d7cdbd7541c, type: 3}
    hairNames: []
    faceNames: []
  - button: {fileID: 758}
    tileImage: {fileID: 0}
    selectedBorder: {fileID: 99}
    descriptionIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9e40e377b496dfc4883de792004dab13, type: 2}
    displayName: Female
    prefab: {fileID: 1709254077376921, guid: 25a547291116fad4590653fca3ae0ce9, type: 3}
    hairNames: []
    faceNames: []
  classes:
  - button: {fileID: 694}
    tileImage: {fileID: 0}
    selectedBorder: {fileID: 98}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 197c4ad1e9077e8419e9e95f3bb2ddb7, type: 2}
    displayName: Brawler
    description: Brawler students are taught to harness the latent powers stored
      deep within their bodies and use this as their greatest weapon. Only students
      demonstrating high strength and coordination test scores qualify for this course,
      as Brawlers have shunned all armed conflict, choosing instead to embrace combat
      in its purest, basest form. They study to master the art of close range combat.
    classId: 1
    genderIndex: 0
    defaultHairType: 1
    defaultHairColorIndex: 3
  - button: {fileID: 670}
    tileImage: {fileID: 0}
    selectedBorder: {fileID: 52}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd1a5f495d04c2f41849c5efce96c996, type: 2}
    displayName: Swordsman
    description: Swordsman students go through the most rigorous training as they
      have to be masters of precision, strength and agility. They embrace the way
      of the sword, living their life not only on the edge but by the edge. Students
      belonging to this class are formidable opponents as they have the highest defense.
      Their goal is to deal a blow that is swift, clean, and most of all, final.
    classId: 2
    genderIndex: 0
    defaultHairType: 0
    defaultHairColorIndex: 8
  - button: {fileID: 689}
    tileImage: {fileID: 0}
    selectedBorder: {fileID: 205}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f57aed991684fb4ea4bb16ecda49adc, type: 2}
    displayName: Archer
    description: The true mark of graduates of Archery is that they never miss a
      target. Their skill with the bow is matchless; their speed, supreme. Great
      allies in every battle, these students are the master of long ranged combat.
      Once they unleash their arrows, they become unstoppable. Their superior evasion
      skills serve as their greatest defense.
    classId: 4
    genderIndex: 1
    defaultHairType: 0
    defaultHairColorIndex: 8
  - button: {fileID: 764}
    tileImage: {fileID: 0}
    selectedBorder: {fileID: 117}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4c4e9a02ea292ae47b5362d3bd10d347, type: 2}
    displayName: Shaman
    description: 'Shaman students are the masters of Qi manipulation. Those who aim
      to take on this course must be prepared to practice strict discipline and enduring
      patience. Shaman students have the strongest spirituality and highest intelligence
      among the classes. Accomplished Shamans can command the elements and even call
      elemental guardians to aid them in battle. '
    classId: 8
    genderIndex: 1
    defaultHairType: 1
    defaultHairColorIndex: 3
